message: "If you use the Uganda Electricity Atlas or its data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Uganda Electricity Atlas"
abstract: "An interactive teaching map and open data set of Uganda's electricity system: power stations, the 400/220/132 kV grid, substations, 33 kV distribution, a DC load-flow model, frequency response after a trip, blackout replays, scenarios for new generation and demand, losses, reliability and access. Built for electrical and mechanical engineering students in renewable energy and power systems units."
